<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00110">
	<title>Reinstalling headrest</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00773">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00774">
								<title>Type A</title>
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV025096.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e00775"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e00776">
								<title>Type B (GT)</title>
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOVGT025002.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e00777"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>To reinstall the headrest:</p>
		<ol>
			<li>
				<p>Put the headrest poles into the holes while pressing the release button (1).</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Recline the seatback with the recline lever or switch.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Adjust the headrest to the appropriate height.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<note type="warning">
			<p>Always make sure the headrest locks into position after reinstalling and adjusting it properly.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>